# Flying and deathtouch. Strix is cast on turn one off two Moxen (and draws). On turn two Bot2 casts a Llanowar Elves
# and an Ornithopter. On turn three Strix attacks: the Elves, a creature without flying or reach, cannot block it (the
# refusal), while the Ornithopter, a flyer, can (the positive control: the same attacker, the same defender). Strix deals
# one damage to the 0/2 Ornithopter, which dies of deathtouch (CR 702.2b); the Ornithopter deals none back.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Baleful Strix
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Baleful Strix.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Baleful Strix)
! Bot2.Block(Llanowar Elves > Baleful Strix)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Baleful Strix)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Damage = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Baleful Strix.Damage = 0
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
